      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, it's professional. But looking at the score, 0.76 feels a bit low for a brand that wants to maintain a \"warm and welcoming\" image. I'm worried it might come across a bit too sterile or cold given how much people are complaining. \n\nCan you try another version? I need it to feel more uplifting and positive so we can steer the conversation back to a good place. Just make sure it actually addresses the eggs and the buffet issue, but try to boost that positivity score a bit more. Just don't turn it into a joke, keep it professional.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
